msgstr "Tīmatahia te matawai kanohi"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Matawai tauira kanohi"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Kāore e taea te tiaki tauira kanohi"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Matawai tauira tuarua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Kāore i taea te tuhi i te tauira tuarua"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Kua tiakina to tauira tuatahi, no reira kua mahi te takiuru kanohi. Me"
" mohio kei te marama tonu to kanohi, kei waenganui hoki, ka ngana ano "
"-- pekehia me te taapiri tauira i muri mai i nga Tautuhinga."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Tāpirihia he tauira kanohi (hiahia)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Ko te takiuru kanohi kia kotahi neke atu i te iti rawa te tauira kanoh"
"i, no reira e kore e taea te peke i tenei karapa. Tuhia ki te marama e"
" noho ana koe. Ka huri te rama i te ahua o to kanohi ki te kaamera, no"
" reira whakaarohia te taapiri i tetahi tauira tuarua i muri mai mai i "
"nga Tautuhinga, ka tuhia i roto i nga rama rereke (hei tauira mo nga r"
"ama o te ahiahi kaore i te awatea)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Tāpirihia he tauira kanohi tuarua (e taunakitia ana)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Kua tiakina to tauira tuatahi. Ka huri te rama i te ahua o to kanohi k"
"i te kaamera: ka ngaro te tauira ka hopukina i te awatea i te ahiahi i"
" raro i nga rama (he rereke ranei), a Ubuntu Hello ka mutu te wa, kaua"
" e wetewete. Ko te tauira tuarua i tuhia i roto i nga rama rereke ka m"
"au tonu te mohiotanga i nga wa katoa o te ra."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Hurihia te rama i te tuatahi: whakakāhia, whakawetohia te rama o te ru"
"ma, te rama tepu ranei, tahuri ke atu i te matapihi, whakakakahuhia ra"
"nei nga mohiti e mau ana koe i etahi wa. Na ka titiro tika ki te kamer"
"a ka pehi i te Matawai."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Tatūnga"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to {} ma te whakamahi i te mot"
"uhēhēnga kanohi (putea kua kitea: {}).\n\n<b>Tūnga TPM:</b> Taki ana i"
" nga taputapu me nga taputapu TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to {} ma te whakamahi i te mot"
"uhēhēnga kanohi (putea kua kitea: {}).\n\n<b>Tūnga TPM:</b> I kitea ng"
"a taputapu TPM. Kei te tāuta aunoatia <i>tpm2-tools</i>..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to {} ma te whakamahi i te mot"
"uhēhēnga kanohi (putea kua kitea: {}).\n\n<b>Tūnga TPM:</b> Pūmārō TPM"
" 2.0 hohe. Ka hiritia to kupuhipa ki roto i te TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to {} ma te whakamahi i te mot"
"uhēhēnga kanohi (putea kua kitea: {}).\n\n<b>Tūnga TPM:</b> I kitea ng"
"a taputapu TPM, engari i rahua te whakaurunga aunoa o <i>tpm2-tools</i"
">. Whakahaerehia <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Ka hoki ki "
"muri ki te keteroki tohu-rorohiko."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ka taea e Ubuntu Hello te iriti aunoa i to {} ma te whakamahi i te mot"
"uhēhēnga kanohi (putea kua kitea: {}).\n\n<b>Tunga TPM:</b> Karekau he"
" taputapu TPM i kitea. Te whakamahi i te keteroki whaimana-rorohiko (A"
"ES-256-GCM)."

