#: src/main.glade:471
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Whakahohehia te motuhēhēnga kanohi ki te wetewete aunoa i to hiri taki"
"uru, KWallet ranei i te takiuru. Ma tenei ka pupuri i to kupu huna kua"
" hiri ki te TPM ina watea, ka whakamunatia ranei ki te AES-256-GCM ma "
"te whakamahi i te matua matua-anake. Ko nga huinga whakamotuhēhē kanoh"
"i PAM_AUTHTOK mo pam_gnome_keyring pam_kwallet5 ranei kei runga i to p"
"apamahi."

